{
  "about": "Loader concepts a convert gap is ranked under. bench/convert_sweep.py tests each pattern (a regular expression) against a refusal message, a not-converted item, or a compiler error with its symbol and location, in this order; the first concept with a matching pattern names the gap. Patterns name loader packages, classes and refusal texts only.",
